function routeLevelOptions(current=''){const rows=[['main',L('رئيسي','Main')],['secondary',L('ثانوي','Secondary')],['distribution',L('توزيع','Distribution')],['drop',L('توصيلة','Drop')],['spare',L('احتياطي','Spare')]];return rows.map(([v,l])=>`<option value="${v}" ${v===current?'selected':''}>${l}</option>`).join('');}
